      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استجاش</span></b> , [from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَيْشٌ</span>,] <i>He demanded,</i> or
<i>summoned, armies,</i> or <i>military forces,</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْ مَحَلِّ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَذَا</span> <i>from such a place.</i> (A.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استجاشهُ</span> <i>He
demanded of him an army,</i> or <i>a military
force.</i> (S.)

